<AdeGuide
  title="Is There an Adult Learner Permit in Texas? No. At 18 You Apply for the License Itself | Road Ready Safety"
  description="No. Texas learner licenses go to applicants 15 to 17 (Transp. Code §521.222). At 18 and over you apply for the driver license directly, with no permit stage. How adults get practice, and the one DPS line to ask about."
